<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: grandiose bestowing ceremony -->
  <GrandioseBestowingCeremony.stages.grandiose_bestowing_ceremony.label>görkemli unvan verme töreni</GrandioseBestowingCeremony.stages.grandiose_bestowing_ceremony.label>
  <!-- EN: The bestowing ceremony was like a taste of true grandeur, and a moment of participation in something greater. -->
  <GrandioseBestowingCeremony.stages.grandiose_bestowing_ceremony.description>Unvan verme töreni gerçek ihtişamdan bir tat gibiydi; daha büyük bir şeye katıldığım bir andı.</GrandioseBestowingCeremony.stages.grandiose_bestowing_ceremony.description>
  
  <!-- EN: honorable bestowing ceremony -->
  <HonorableBestowingCeremony.stages.honorable_bestowing_ceremony.label>onurlu unvan verme töreni</HonorableBestowingCeremony.stages.honorable_bestowing_ceremony.label>
  <!-- EN: The bestowing ceremony brought a sense of dignity and honor to the participants. -->
  <HonorableBestowingCeremony.stages.honorable_bestowing_ceremony.description>Unvan verme töreni katılımcılara bir haysiyet ve onur duygusu verdi.</HonorableBestowingCeremony.stages.honorable_bestowing_ceremony.description>
  
  <!-- EN: terrible bestowing ceremony -->
  <TerribleBestowingCeremony.stages.terrible_bestowing_ceremony.label>berbat unvan verme töreni</TerribleBestowingCeremony.stages.terrible_bestowing_ceremony.label>
  <!-- EN: The bestowing ceremony somehow felt petty and self-indulgent at the same time. -->
  <TerribleBestowingCeremony.stages.terrible_bestowing_ceremony.description>Unvan verme töreni nedense hem değersiz hem de bencilce geldi.</TerribleBestowingCeremony.stages.terrible_bestowing_ceremony.description>
  
  <!-- EN: unimpressive bestowing ceremony -->
  <UnimpressiveBestowingCeremony.stages.unimpressive_bestowing_ceremony.label>sönük unvan verme töreni</UnimpressiveBestowingCeremony.stages.unimpressive_bestowing_ceremony.label>
  <!-- EN: The bestowing ceremony felt mechanical and lifeless. -->
  <UnimpressiveBestowingCeremony.stages.unimpressive_bestowing_ceremony.description>Unvan verme töreni mekanik ve cansız geldi.</UnimpressiveBestowingCeremony.stages.unimpressive_bestowing_ceremony.description>
  
</LanguageData>